# BCP 47 primary language subtags, fifteen-tag slice
# Resource file.  Order assertions only; at the nominal sort there are none.
#
# The slice holds fifteen ISO 639-1 two-letter primary subtags from the IANA
# Language Subtag Registry.  A registry supplies identity between its
# concepts and no relation over them, so this file asserts none.  The
# concepts and their labels are carried as metadata.
#
# Registry uniqueness, which makes the subtags pairwise distinct, is a rule
# the parties adopt and is recorded in bcp47-uniqueness.ttl.  Keeping it out
# of the resource is what lets a refutation report which of its premises a
# party may withdraw.
#
# Grounding for this operand is membership in the slice.  A value naming a
# subtag outside it is ungrounded, and the verdict is Unknown with that value
# as the certificate.
#
# Selection: de and fr are required by the motivating example; the remaining
# thirteen give EU-official-language coverage for the set operators; fifteen
# matches the GeoNames and DPV slices.

@prefix odrlkb:  <https://w3id.org/odrl-kb/bcp47#> .
@prefix rdfs:    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix dcterms: <http://purl.org/dc/terms/> .
@prefix xsd:     <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

<https://w3id.org/odrl-kb/bcp47> a dcterms:Standard ;
    dcterms:title "BCP 47 primary language subtags, fifteen-tag slice"@en ;
    dcterms:source
        <https://www.iana.org/assignments/language-subtag-registry> ;
    dcterms:conformsTo <https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc5646> ;
    dcterms:date "TODO registry file date"^^xsd:date ;
    dcterms:issued "TODO retrieval date"^^xsd:date ;
    dcterms:license <https://www.iana.org/help/licensing-terms> ;
    dcterms:extent "15 concepts, no order assertions" .

odrlkb:LanguageTag a rdfs:Class ;
    rdfs:label "BCP 47 primary language subtag"@en .

odrlkb:bg a odrlkb:LanguageTag ; rdfs:label "Bulgarian"@en  .
odrlkb:cs a odrlkb:LanguageTag ; rdfs:label "Czech"@en      .
odrlkb:da a odrlkb:LanguageTag ; rdfs:label "Danish"@en     .
odrlkb:de a odrlkb:LanguageTag ; rdfs:label "German"@en     .
odrlkb:el a odrlkb:LanguageTag ; rdfs:label "Greek"@en      .
odrlkb:en a odrlkb:LanguageTag ; rdfs:label "English"@en    .
odrlkb:es a odrlkb:LanguageTag ; rdfs:label "Spanish"@en    .
odrlkb:fi a odrlkb:LanguageTag ; rdfs:label "Finnish"@en    .
odrlkb:fr a odrlkb:LanguageTag ; rdfs:label "French"@en     .
odrlkb:hu a odrlkb:LanguageTag ; rdfs:label "Hungarian"@en  .
odrlkb:it a odrlkb:LanguageTag ; rdfs:label "Italian"@en    .
odrlkb:nl a odrlkb:LanguageTag ; rdfs:label "Dutch"@en      .
odrlkb:pl a odrlkb:LanguageTag ; rdfs:label "Polish"@en     .
odrlkb:pt a odrlkb:LanguageTag ; rdfs:label "Portuguese"@en .
odrlkb:sv a odrlkb:LanguageTag ; rdfs:label "Swedish"@en    .
